{"content_hash": "0a7d6dae16b8d57c", "version_id": 102, "article_id": 11, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Scientists Fix a Small Mistake in a Science Paper", "title_zh": "科学家修正论文里的一处小错误", "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11244-6", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51733627413_8ff72ca7da_b.jpg", "credit": "₡ґǘșϯγ Ɗᶏ Ⱪᶅṏⱳդ · cc0 1.0 · via flickr"}, "published_date": "2026-10-06", "word_count": 151, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "A team of scientists at MIT wrote a paper about hydrogen and metal membranes. Later, they found a small labelling mistake in one of their figures. They published a correction to fix it.", "lead_zh": "麻省理工学院的一个科学家团队写了一篇关于氢气和金属膜的论文。后来，他们发现其中一张图里有一个标签写错了。他们发表了一则更正来修正这个问题。", "preview": "The original paper appeared in the journal Nature on 9 September 2026. The authors work at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) i", "preview_zh": "这篇原论文于2026年9月9日发表在《自然》杂志上。作者们在美国麻省理工学院（MIT）工作。他们的研究是关于钯膜以及它如何帮助提取氢气。主要作者是约格什·苏伦德拉纳特。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 92, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@6732e7c/content/audio/11/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 65.236, "size_bytes": 395280, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 175, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@6732e7c/content/data/versions/102.json", "paragraphs": ["The original paper appeared in the journal Nature on 9 September 2026. The authors work at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) in the United States. Their study is about palladium membranes and how they help extract hydrogen. The main author is Yogesh Surendranath.", "In the first version of the paper, Figure 3c had a wrong label. The far-left bar said \"Pd-Ag under OCP.\" It should have said \"Pd under OCP.\" This is a small but important detail for other scientists who read the work.", "The correction was published on 6 October 2026, about one month after the original paper. The authors changed the label in both the HTML and PDF versions. The science itself did not change. Only the figure label was fixed.", "This kind of correction is normal in science. Journals publish them to keep the record correct. Readers can now see the right label in the updated paper."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这篇原论文于2026年9月9日发表在《自然》杂志上。作者们在美国麻省理工学院（MIT）工作。他们的研究是关于钯膜以及它如何帮助提取氢气。主要作者是约格什·苏伦德拉纳特。", "在论文的第一个版本中，图3c有一个标签写错了。最左边的柱子写的是“OCP下的Pd-Ag”。它本应写成“OCP下的Pd”。对于阅读这项工作的其他科学家来说，这是一个虽小但重要的细节。", "更正于2026年10月6日发布，距离原论文大约一个月。作者们修改了HTML版和PDF版中的标签。科学内容本身没有改变。只有图表的标签被修正了。", "这种更正科学界很常见。期刊发布它们是为了保持记录的准确性。现在读者可以在更新后的论文中看到正确的标签了。"], "body": "The original paper appeared in the journal Nature on 9 September 2026. The authors work at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) in the United States. Their study is about palladium membranes and how they help extract hydrogen. The main author is Yogesh Surendranath.\n\nIn the first version of the paper, Figure 3c had a wrong label. The far-left bar said \"Pd-Ag under OCP.\" It should have said \"Pd under OCP.\" This is a small but important detail for other scientists who read the work.\n\nThe correction was published on 6 October 2026, about one month after the original paper. The authors changed the label in both the HTML and PDF versions. The science itself did not change. Only the figure label was fixed.\n\nThis kind of correction is normal in science. Journals publish them to keep the record correct. Readers can now see the right label in the updated paper.", "body_zh": "这篇原论文于2026年9月9日发表在《自然》杂志上。作者们在美国麻省理工学院（MIT）工作。他们的研究是关于钯膜以及它如何帮助提取氢气。主要作者是约格什·苏伦德拉纳特。\n\n在论文的第一个版本中，图3c有一个标签写错了。最左边的柱子写的是“OCP下的Pd-Ag”。它本应写成“OCP下的Pd”。对于阅读这项工作的其他科学家来说，这是一个虽小但重要的细节。\n\n更正于2026年10月6日发布，距离原论文大约一个月。作者们修改了HTML版和PDF版中的标签。科学内容本身没有改变。只有图表的标签被修正了。\n\n这种更正科学界很常见。期刊发布它们是为了保持记录的准确性。现在读者可以在更新后的论文中看到正确的标签了。", "text": "The original paper appeared in the journal Nature on 9 September 2026. The authors work at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) in the United States. Their study is about palladium membranes and how they help extract hydrogen. The main author is Yogesh Surendranath. In the first version of the paper, Figure 3c had a wrong label. The far-left bar said \"Pd-Ag under OCP.\" It should have said \"Pd under OCP.\" This is a small but important detail for other scientists who read the work. The correction was published on 6 October 2026, about one month after the original paper. The authors changed the label in both the HTML and PDF versions. The science itself did not change. Only the figure label was fixed. This kind of correction is normal in science. Journals publish them to keep the record correct. Readers can now see the right label in the updated paper.", "vocab": [{"word": "correction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更正；修正", "note": "指对已发表内容中错误的正式修改"}, {"word": "paper", "pos": "noun", "zh": "论文", "note": "在科学语境中常指学术文章"}, {"word": "journal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "期刊；杂志", "note": "如《自然》这样的学术刊物"}, {"word": "label", "pos": "noun", "zh": "标签", "note": "图表上的文字标记"}, {"word": "figure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "图；图表", "note": "论文中的插图或图表"}, {"word": "version", "pos": "noun", "zh": "版本", "note": "如HTML版、PDF版"}, {"word": "publish", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发表；出版", "note": "常用被动语态"}, {"word": "membrane", "pos": "noun", "zh": "膜", "note": "这里指钯膜，用于分离氢气"}], "title_original": "Author Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H<sub>2</sub> extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "summary_original": "Nature, Published online: 06 October 2026;\ndoi:10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "body_original": "Download PDF\nAuthor Correction\nPublished:\n06 October 2026\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation\nRui Zeng\n(\n曾瑞\n)\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0002-7577-767X\n1\n,\nJulian Ufert\nOR